message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "Engineering Interactive Exam"
abstract: >-
  An interactive exam platform for engineering students to practice technical
  writing, grammar, and engineering English. Features 219 curated questions
  across 28 categories, with server-side grading, rate limiting, and
  comprehensive unit tests. Built with ASP.NET Core 10, Entity Framework Core,
  and vanilla JavaScript.
